    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81503" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικείρω</span></b> , aor.
		inf. -<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεῖραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					61
				</span></i>
			 : pf. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέκαρκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Symp.</u>
					32
				</span></i>
			:—<i>shear</i> or <i>clip all round</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν κόμην κακῶς π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.154
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινά</span>
			<i>clip</i> him <i>close</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
			</span></i> l. c. :—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίχας περικείρεσθαι</span>
			<i>clip one's</i> hair, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.71
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. κατὰ πρόσωπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Je.</u>
					32.9
				</span></i>
			(<i><span class="en">
				25.23
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς πλοκάμους περικειρόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Tim.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Περικειρομένη</span>, title of
			play by Menander. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			metaph., <i>shear</i> of its walls, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀκρόπολιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>VH</u>
					7.8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
